+// browser: while one lives on this thread, fallback iteration starts no font
+// load (no BeginLoadIfNeeded, no WillUseRange). A face still loading is
+// passed over, as a draw passes over it; one whose load has not begun comes
+// back as a candidate, with its loading-fallback data. FontFallbackList's
+// primary-font lookup is not covered: it begins a load unguarded. For readers
+// the page must not see, such as the canvas text record's read-time shaping
+// (Page.agentCanvasText), which shapes with a page's font only when a draw
+// determined that font's primary font on its current list.
+class PLATFORM_EXPORT ScopedNoFontLoads {
+  STACK_ALLOCATED();
